<title>NETHERLANDS: VNU sees higher 1997 net profit.</title>
<headline>VNU sees higher 1997 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher NV Verenigd Bezit VNU said on Tuesday it expected its net profit and ordinary earnings per share to rise in 1997.  </p>
<p>VNU said it expected a &quot;clear&quot; increase in earnings this year from consumer magazines, educational publishing and Business Information Europe and a &quot;significant&quot; rise in earnings from newspapers and Business Information USA.</p>
<p>VNU said market conditions for commercial television remained &quot;uncertain&quot; but that it expected &quot;some improvement&quot; in results this year after a one million guilder loss in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
